paragraph = "Inject actual host storage/resource refusal during the common terminal entitlement-seal transition: no partial q/count/root/ring/F06 changes survive. Restart after committed completion but lost response recovers same receipt. History suspension before aggregation seal freezes history_allowed=false: F07 decays even if F05 produces a positive score, while F06 reward mathematics remain unchanged. Suspension after seal cannot rewrite that epoch and applies to a later seal. F03/F05 never read F07 for scoring eligibility."
qualification = "UNRUN"

